  {
   "name": "short-circuit-current-calculation-worked-example-diagram",
   "alt": "short circuit current calculation single line diagram for a 630 kVA transformer LV panel fault",
   "caption": "Diagram by Instrumentation Blog showing the article example: a 630 kVA, 6 percent transformer and 30 m of 35 mm2 cable give 7.62 kA symmetrical and 16.8 kA peak at the panel.",
   "after_h2": "Worked Example: 630 kVA Transformer LV Panel",
   "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 560\" width=\"100%\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">\n<title>Single line diagram of the 630 kVA transformer short circuit worked example</title>\n<rect width=\"800\" height=\"560\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Worked Example: Fault at the LV Panel</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"110\" width=\"110\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<text x=\"95\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#334155\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Grid</text>\n<text x=\"95\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#4b5563\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">strong</text>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"150\" r=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"150\" r=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"262\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">630 kVA, 415 V</text>\n<text x=\"262\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6 % impedance</text>\n<line x1=\"306\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<rect x=\"380\" y=\"136\" width=\"170\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35 mm² Cu, 30 m</text>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.554 Ω/km</text>\n<line x1=\"550\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<line x1=\"620\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#334155\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LV panel</text>\n<polygon points=\"660,120 640,152 656,152 636,184 676,144 660,144 680,120\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/>\n<text x=\"700\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\">Fault</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"242\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fef2f2\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">Zt = 0.06 × 415² ÷ 630,000</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.01640 Ω</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"286\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">Zc = 0.554 × 30 ÷ 1000</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.01662 Ω</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"330\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fef2f2\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"358\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">Z total</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"358\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.03302 Ω</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"374\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"402\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">I&#x27;&#x27;k = 1.05 × 415 ÷ (1.732 × 0.03302)</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"402\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">7.62 kA</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"418\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fef2f2\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"446\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">κ at X/R 5 = 1.02 + 0.98 × e^(−0.6)</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"446\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">1.558</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"462\" width=\"720\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\">ip = 1.558 × 1.414 × 7,620</text>\n<text x=\"740\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">16.8 kA</text>\n<text x=\"400\" y=\"540\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Choose a breaker of 10 kA interrupting and at least 16.8 kA peak withstand</text>\n</svg>"
  },
  {
   "name": "short-circuit-current-calculation-iec-60909-flowchart",
   "alt": "IEC 60909 short circuit current calculation flowchart from impedance to I k and peak ip",
   "caption": "Diagram by Instrumentation Blog tracing the IEC 60909 steps: sum the impedances, find the symmetrical current, the kappa factor and the peak, then match each value to equipment ratings.",
   "after_h2": "The Calculation Formulas: IEC 60909 Method",
   "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" width=\"100%\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">\n<title>Flowchart of the IEC 60909 short circuit current calculation</title>\n<rect width=\"800\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IEC 60909 Short Circuit Calculation Path</text>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"58\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"87.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Add series impedances</text>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"111.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">source + transformer + cable</text>\n<line x1=\"400\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"150\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"179.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">I&#x27;&#x27;k = c × Vn ÷ (√3 × Zk)</text>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"203.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c = 1.05 LV, 1.10 HV</text>\n<line x1=\"400\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"242\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"271.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">κ = 1.02 + 0.98 × e^(−3R/X)</text>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"295.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">from the X/R ratio</text>\n<line x1=\"400\" y1=\"312\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"334\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"334\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"363.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ip = κ × √2 × I&#x27;&#x27;k</text>\n<text x=\"400.0\" y=\"387.3\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">peak asymmetrical</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"430\" width=\"330\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"205.0\" y=\"461.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Use I&#x27;&#x27;k for</text>\n<text x=\"205.0\" y=\"484.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">breaker interrupting rating,</text>\n<text x=\"205.0\" y=\"507.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">fuses, relays, earth</text>\n<text x=\"205.0\" y=\"530.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a2b4a\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">conductor, CTs</text>\n<rect x=\"430\" y=\"430\" width=\"330\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"595.0\" y=\"461.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Use ip for</text>\n<text x=\"595.0\" y=\"484.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">breaker momentary rating,</text>\n<text x=\"595.0\" y=\"507.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">busbar bracing,</text>\n<text x=\"595.0\" y=\"530.45\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cable supports</text>\n<polyline points=\"400,404 400,414 205,414 205,428\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<polyline points=\"400,414 595,414 595,428\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<text x=\"400\" y=\"584\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#4b5563\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Add running motor contribution, about 6 × In each, near large motors</text>\n</svg>"
  },
